- Building and maintenance of kits in the office;

- Going away to install broadcast services and permanent installations for cricket boards.

As part of our team, you’ll take on a central role in ensuring smooth, accurate tracking of sessions, whether monitoring them live or reviewing them retrospectively. You'll be the key contact for our analysts, offering guidance and solutions remotely to ensure they can work seamlessly.

In collaboration with our talented developers, you’ll help test and refine software components, suggesting improvements to enhance system performance. Your hands-on skills will also come into play as you build and maintain kits in the office, keeping our equipment ready for action.

This role has a dynamic, on-the-go element, too! You’ll occasionally travel to set up for cricket boards, manage broadcasts, and handle installations, assisting the full lifecycle of our innovative systems on-site.

